                <h1 id="wb-cont">Canadian Astronomy Data Centre</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lead">Enabling the next astronomical discoveries</p>
    </div>
    <div class="well">
        <section id="r_and_d" class="provisional gc-followus">
            <h2>Research &amp; Development</h2>
            <ul>
                <li class="small"><a href="https://github.com/opencadc" class="github" rel="external"><span class="wb-inv">GitHub: </span>OpenCADC</a></li>
                <li class="small"><a href="https://amt.coretrustseal.org/certificates" class="coretrustseal" rel="external"><span class="wb-inv">CoreTrustSeal</span>CoreTustSeal Certified</a></li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="mrgn-bttm-xl mrgn-tp-md">
        <p>The CADC's data collection, along with its world-leading cloud infrastructure for astronomy, provides a unique resource for data-intensive astrophysical research.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <h2 class="mrgn-bttm-lg mrgn-tp-0">Telescope data</h2>
            <dl class="mrgn-tp-md">
                <dt><a href="/en/jwst/">JWST</a></dt>
                <dd>James Webb Space Telescope</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/gemini/">Gemini</a></dt>
                <dd>Gemini observatory</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/cfht/">CFHT</a></dt>
                <dd>Canada France Hawai'i Telescope</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/jcmt/">JCMT</a></dt>
                <dd>James Clerk Maxwell Telescope</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/hst/">HST</a></dt>
                <dd>Hubble Space Telescope</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/dao/">DAO</a></dt>
                <dd>Dominion Astrophysical Observatory Science Archive</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/drao/">DRAO</a></dt>
                <dd>Dominion Radio Astrophysical Observatory Science Archive</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/omm/">OMM</a></dt>
                <dd>Mont Mégantic Observatory</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/neossat/">NEOSSat</a></dt>
                <dd>Near-Earth Object Surveillance Satellite</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/brite/">BRITE-Constellation</a></dt>
                <dd>BRITE Target Explorer-Constellation</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/blast/">BLAST</a></dt>
                <dd>Balloon-borne Large-Aperture Submillimeter Telescope</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/macho/">MACHO</a></dt>
                <dd>MAssive Compact Halo Object project</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/most/">MOST</a></dt>
                <dd>Microvariability & Oscillations of Stars Telescope</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/fuse/">FUSE</a></dt>
                <dd>Far Ultraviolet Spectroscopic Explorer</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/ukirt/">UKIRT</a></dt>
                <dd>United Kingdom IfraRed Telescope</dd>
            
            </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6 brdr-lft">
            <h2 class="mrgn-bttm-lg mrgn-tp-0">Advanced data products</h2>
            <dl class="mrgn-tp-md">
                <dt><a href="/en/megapipe/">MegaPipe</a></dt>
                <dd>MegaPipe image stacking pipeline</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/scla/">SCLA</a></dt>
                <dd>The Suprime-Cam Legacy Archive</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/racs/">RACS</a></dt>
                <dd>Rapid ASKAP Continuum Survey DR1</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/wallaby/">WALLABY</a></dt>
                <dd>Widefield ASKAP L-band Legacy All-sky Blind surveY</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/possum/">POSSUM</a></dt>
                <dd>POlarization Sky Survey of the Universe’s Magnetism</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/jcmt/scubalc.html">SCUBA-LC</a></dt>
                <dd>JCMT SCUBA Legacy Catalogue Datasets</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/hsthla/">HLA</a></dt>
                <dd>Hubble Legacy Archive</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/iris/">IRIS</a></dt>
                <dd>Improved Reprocessing of the IRAS Survey</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/cgps/">CGPS</a></dt>
                <dd>Canadian Galactic Plane Survey</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/cfht/cfhtls.html">CFHTLS</a></dt>
                <dd>Canada France Hawai'i Telescope Legacy Survey</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/wirwolf/">WIRWolf</a></dt>
                <dd>WIRWolf image stacking pipeline</dd>
            
                <dt><a href="/en/vlass/">VLASS</a></dt>
                <dd>Very Large Array Sky Survey</dd>
            
            </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6 brdr-lft">
            <h2 class="mrgn-bttm-lg mrgn-tp-0">Services</h2>
